{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33294","headline":"秦原览古 · 于濆","name":"秦原览古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耕者戮力地，龙虎曾角逐。\n火德道将亨，夜逢虵母哭。\n昔日望夷宫，是处寻桑谷。\n汉祖竟爲龙，赵高徒指鹿。\n当时行路人，已合伤心目。\n汉祚又千年，秦原草还绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}